{"3993790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Star Catcher", "steam_appid": 3993790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <u><strong>What is Star Catcher? </strong></u><br>_________________________________________________________________________</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are <strong>The Fallow</strong>. A herbivorous and peaceful people. We have a duty: to be stewards of this sea and to free the souls lost within it. They are the scattered star-lights in the sea and the sky. We free the souls by guiding them and offering passage to the Beyond at the centre of our world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/e89954908fecdc0efc27eee6a37de7fa.poster.avif?t=1781861806\" width=816 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/e89954908fecdc0efc27eee6a37de7fa.webm?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/e89954908fecdc0efc27eee6a37de7fa.mp4?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>__________________________________________________________________________</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></u><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Catch Lost Souls!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A twist on the fishing fantasy! Attune to lost souls by casting your lure out into the stars and complete astral minigames to catch them. Different soul types can be discovered across the entire world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/15f1399077dc8218061933ae90bdd84c.poster.avif?t=1781861806\" width=998 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/15f1399077dc8218061933ae90bdd84c.webm?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/15f1399077dc8218061933ae90bdd84c.mp4?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>_________________________________________________________________________</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Sea of Stars! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail between 20+ islands on your own personal ship with your friends! Search on foot through an archipelago lost to time to discover new souls, artefacts, secrets, fishing spots and characters!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/7580db9e8dc090218c6ca80709076d83.poster.avif?t=1781861806\" width=998 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/7580db9e8dc090218c6ca80709076d83.webm?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/7580db9e8dc090218c6ca80709076d83.mp4?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>__________________________________________________________________________</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share the adventure with Friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full single-player journey you can enjoy peacefully alone, or share with up to four friends in the same world. Unwind together, fish in the same space, and celebrate with text/voice chat and emotes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/8f1b7c86b8729bf419d2e99db936fc1c.poster.avif?t=1781861806\" width=998 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/8f1b7c86b8729bf419d2e99db936fc1c.webm?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/8f1b7c86b8729bf419d2e99db936fc1c.mp4?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>_________________________________________________________________________</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release the souls you catch to the Beyond in order to receive pearls and restore beauty to this ancient world. As you release more souls, you'll gain access to new islands, areas, NPCs and souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/7acaf65eaeca0a36e94e5ad6a9cc362b.avif?t=1781861806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras_big/7acaf65eaeca0a36e94e5ad6a9cc362b.webp?t=1781861806 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>_________________________________________________________________________</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customise Your Fishing with Artefacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip different artefacts to customise your fishing experience! The balance between Challenge, Risk, and Reward is entirely up to you.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/fe78005995b98bb1513a4a5abedd2dae.avif?t=1781861806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras_big/fe78005995b98bb1513a4a5abedd2dae.avif?t=1781861806 width=1560 height=824 /></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>_________________________________________________________________________</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn, Progress and Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your reputation among other Fallow by gifting them the pearls you receive from fishing. As you grow closer, other Fallow will offer you new artefacts, customisation options, soul locations, and lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/a5caa274366e13bb3e73176a6bccf148.poster.avif?t=1781861806\" width=998 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/a5caa274366e13bb3e73176a6bccf148.webm?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/a5caa274366e13bb3e73176a6bccf148.mp4?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>_________________________________________________________________________</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customise Your Appearance!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself by customising your Fallow! Equip different skin or clothing options; or express yourself with a variety of emotes to show off to your friends!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/08ce4d380588ff336f2a7336ed80a207.poster.avif?t=1781861806\" width=1000 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/08ce4d380588ff336f2a7336ed80a207.webm?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/08ce4d380588ff336f2a7336ed80a207.mp4?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>_________________________________________________________________________</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the mystery of the Beyond</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Catcher is a timeless world with it's own people and culture. Embrace their beautiful traditions, and with every catch you make, every character you meet and every discovery you uncover, you draw closer to the truth of what awaits you within the Beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/5f70e996fa3ae147921d96d993efe271.poster.avif?t=1781861806\" width=998 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/5f70e996fa3ae147921d96d993efe271.webm?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/5f70e996fa3ae147921d96d993efe271.mp4?t=1781861806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras/bbc1caf9801f6502cf63064703788ae2.avif?t=1781861806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993790/extras_big/bbc1caf9801f6502cf63064703788ae2.webp?t=1781861806 width=1560 height=1561 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: cen